$D760 w BlitColumn13 8 ; Blit addresses, column 13 (16 cells)
$D780 w BlitColumn14 9 ; Blit addresses, column 14 (17 cells)
$D7A2 w BlitColumn15 8 ; Blit addresses, column 15 (16 cells)
$D7C2 w BlitColumn16 9 ; Blit addresses, column 16 (17 cells)
$D7E4 w BlitColumn17 8 ; Blit addresses, column 17 (16 cells)
$D804 w BlitColumn18 9 ; Blit addresses, column 18 (17 cells)
$D826 w BlitColumn19 8 ; Blit addresses, column 19 (16 cells)
