$E1DD TemplateChosen
$E1DE ; launched objects: $C1B0-$C200
$E1E1 LaunchObject ; DE = template, HL = the first slot: 6 slots
$E1E6 FreeSlotLoop ; bit 7: a free slot
$E1EE ; all taken: no launch
$E1F0 FillSlot ; 9 bytes of template, 7 zero
$E1FA ZeroRecordTail
$E1FE ; the position of the firer
$E213 CheckSpeed ; the speed
$E21A ; no speed, no height behaviour ...
$E221 ; ... and not the player: nothing more
$E22E StandStill ; no step along or across
$E235 RecordDying ; the explosion counter + 2
$E23A ; 45: gone
$E245 StoreExplosion
