$E8FD HeightFloor ; below 3 or wrapped: 2
$E8FF HeightAfterUp
$E904 GroundVehicle ; the ground vehicle: speed, not height
$E907 ; being hit: no steering
$E90D ; fire and up together: speed 1 (the shell is lobbed)
$E915 CheckSlowDown ; down: slower, spending the reserve
$E926 CheckSpeedUp ; up: faster, earning the reserve back to 32
$E936 StoreVehicleSpeed
